That's me, baby.

62
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:50,420
So why are we here?

63
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:55,240
This morning, May 13th, 1973...

64
00:02:56,500 --> 00:03:00,200
We begin the investigation of the world's first extraterrestrial contact.

65
00:03:01,100 --> 00:03:01,540
Nice.

66
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,260
So we're not alone.

67
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:07,540
And we're the first to know.

68
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:09,760
So all these people are talking here at the same time.

69
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:11,140
Hmm.

70
00:03:13,060 --> 00:03:16,280
Ten days ago, a meteor crashed down in Cape Espenburg, Alaska.

71
00:03:16,980 --> 00:03:18,280
